    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33898" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parmŭla</span></b> , ae, f.
		dim.
		1. parma, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a little</i>, <i>round shield</i>,
				<i>a small target.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">relictā non bene parmulā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 2, 7, 10</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 238</span></i>
			Müll.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parmulam ventilare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Front. Or. Ep. 1</span></i>
			 Mai.</div>
